      "explanation": "Exception RS 61 sets a 0.45 m minimum side yard setback, a 3.6 m minimum setback from a side lot line abutting a street, allows a detached house on a lot with at least 6.0 m of frontage, and requires compliance with exception 900.4.10(336). No prevailing by-laws apply.",
