    "900.4.10(25)": {
      "explanation": "Exception RS 25 requires compliance with exception 900.4.10(336). A semi-detached house needs at least 15.0 m frontage and 510 square metres lot area, 1.2 m side setbacks and 2.4 m from a street side lot line; a detached house needs 15.0 m frontage, 510 square metres, 0.45 m side setbacks and 2.4 m from a street side lot line. Both must be 22.0 m from the original centreline of Birchmount Rd. or Kennedy Rd. where the lot abuts them (not checked). No prevailing by-laws apply.",
